<title>HONG KONG: Prestige Prop 1996 net rises sharply.</title>
<headline>Prestige Prop 1996 net rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	8.6    vs 1.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) 3.0    vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			 56.70  vs 8.23</p>
<p>    Turnover		  598.19 vs 365.82</p>
<p>    Company name	    Prestige Properties Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     May 26-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	June 6</p>
<p>NOTE - Property development and investment company Prestige Properties was formerly Playmates Properties Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is four H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs one cent.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
